PhotoVault is a professional App for you to secures photos and videos.
This app will NEVER upload your photos or videos to the cloud. And also the local data saved in your device are encrypted by AES. So there is no way to access your photos and videos without your passcode.
Main features:
- FaceID && Touch ID;
- Custom albums;
- Manager medias in album easily;
- Import && export with just one click;
- Beautiful design and easy to use;
- Full-screen viewing photos and videos;
- Local data encrypted;
More features are coming.
Contact us: x_feedback@hotmail.com

